# 统一文本文件行尾为 LF，避免 Windows 检出 CRLF 造成无意义 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换与 diff
# `.onnx` 必须列在这里：随包模型已入库（resources/{yolo,face}-models），而 `* text=auto eol=lf`
# 一旦把 protobuf 当文本做了行尾转换，字节就变了 —— `@shared/yoloCatalog` 里钉死的 sha256 会对不上，
# 安装包里的模型也直接损坏，而且不会有任何报错，只表现为推理结果变差。
*.onnx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mov binary
*.zip binary
*.pak binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
